<title>CHINA: Mingly Corp year net rises 86 percent.</title>
<headline>Mingly Corp year net rises 86 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   39.6     vs  21.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5	vs  3.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs  46.5 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    750.7    vs  403.6</p>
<p>    Turnover		     4,151.4  vs  2,820.1</p>
<p>    Company name		 The Mingly Corporation Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 24-29</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Mingly Corp has interests in property development and management, hotel services and cloth dyeing and printing.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one new share for every 10 shares held.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is five H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.5 cents) vs five cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
